+Show the Config
+----------------
+
+To inspect the application's configuration, use the :func:`config <cli.config_command>` command. It prints the configuration as JSON. Sensitive values (keys containing SECRET, PASSWORD, TOKEN, or KEY) are masked as ``***``. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      "SQLALCHEMY_DATABASE_URI": "sqlite:///app.db"
+    }
+
+
 .. _dotenv:
 
 Environment Variables From dotenv
